 "text": "Hello, how are things going? That's completely normal. Lots of bike shop cyclists are happily slow. Sure, no problem. What's his level? That's doable. Focus on relaxing and breathing, and don't push too hard. Oof, that happens to people all the time. Grab a spare from the shed or order one online. You' welcome. Just take it easy for a few runs while it wears in. Great. Push a little harder than you think you should, and he' pick up the pace. That works too. Either way, he' finish the session feeling like he' made progress.",
